{"2640300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evolution Survival", "steam_appid": 2640300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution Survival is a planetary survival sandbox where <strong>every plant, creature, and the whole ecosystem evolves in real time.</strong> Build biodomes, engineer genetics, and shape the environment to keep your player alive as your star ages, the atmosphere shifts, and natural selection rewrites the world around you. Your actions influence which species thrive, mutate, or go extinct. You can survive alone, or control the world with your friends, and create a safe haven in this hostile environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/7ef59d973fdfe3cbfe3b7767414e6df2.avif?t=1785716835\" width=900 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/c76bd4d244e804d94c1ae33402cd4574.poster.avif?t=1785716835\" width=1096 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/c76bd4d244e804d94c1ae33402cd4574.webm?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/c76bd4d244e804d94c1ae33402cd4574.mp4?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The star, plants, animals, and rocks will change as time moves past, the game simulates evolution as if hundreds of generations happen with each new offspring. Animals may sprout 7 legs and 5 mouths, maybe trees will prefer to be upside down. The star, if massive enough may go supernova after expanding as it burns helium, becoming a neutron star or black hole. Perhaps it will just become a white dwarf and fade slowly for trillions of years. Maybe you will not get a star at all, just a failed star called a brown dwarf that glows for a little while before fizzing out. The Rocks will erode away and leave pebbles and stones for you to pick up and use in your crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/ee38e787623c4a56692b2688ce65ea60.webp?t=1785716835\" width=364 height=48 /></span>*K-Type main sequence star lifecycle<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/0cedc1d5f5e320e70dc01f90770c390d.avif?t=1785716835\" width=748 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/413982015ce6f77c7d99d5c1e8b8208f.poster.avif?t=1785716835\" width=1096 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/413982015ce6f77c7d99d5c1e8b8208f.webm?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/413982015ce6f77c7d99d5c1e8b8208f.mp4?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt unique animals and forage the wilderness to survive. Create shelters and outposts to craft better tools and equip yourself to conquer the world's resources. As you play the animals around you will interact with each other and the plants that surround them. You can tame, breed, and ride them as you explore this unforgiving place. Lay low in the jungle and use precision strikes to keep yourself fed, or build a large base in the high plains and assert your territorial control with high caliber artillery and perimeter defenses. As you are not the only one in this universe to know about this planet, you may run into an intelligent species eager to claim its resources for their own. It's up to you to determine the outcome of your interactions. But rest assured, they want your resources. Pay attention to your sun as it ages. Once it's gone, all life is on borrowed time...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/78a101c0df6fed62ab7f880bfa67fd61.avif?t=1785716835\" width=354 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PVP/Multiplayer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a dedicated server, or host a session on your machine with your friends, and if you wish, open up either to the public. Conquer your surroundings, drill for the most prized resources, and adapt to this world. Aim to plunder the loot of other players and build impregnable strongholds. Survival will not be easy with more enemies around. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Kit:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the game comes another application, the Evolution Survival Development Kit. This provides a means to make mods and maps for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution Survival is a planetary survival sandbox where <strong>every plant, creature, and the whole ecosystem evolves in real time.</strong> Build biodomes, engineer genetics, and shape the environment to keep your player alive as your star ages, the atmosphere shifts, and natural selection rewrites the world around you. Your actions influence which species thrive, mutate, or go extinct. You can survive alone, or control the world with your friends, and create a safe haven in this hostile environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/7ef59d973fdfe3cbfe3b7767414e6df2.avif?t=1785716835\" width=900 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/c76bd4d244e804d94c1ae33402cd4574.poster.avif?t=1785716835\" width=1096 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/c76bd4d244e804d94c1ae33402cd4574.webm?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/c76bd4d244e804d94c1ae33402cd4574.mp4?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The star, plants, animals, and rocks will change as time moves past, the game simulates evolution as if hundreds of generations happen with each new offspring. Animals may sprout 7 legs and 5 mouths, maybe trees will prefer to be upside down. The star, if massive enough may go supernova after expanding as it burns helium, becoming a neutron star or black hole. Perhaps it will just become a white dwarf and fade slowly for trillions of years. Maybe you will not get a star at all, just a failed star called a brown dwarf that glows for a little while before fizzing out. The Rocks will erode away and leave pebbles and stones for you to pick up and use in your crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/ee38e787623c4a56692b2688ce65ea60.webp?t=1785716835\" width=364 height=48 /></span>*K-Type main sequence star lifecycle<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/0cedc1d5f5e320e70dc01f90770c390d.avif?t=1785716835\" width=748 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/413982015ce6f77c7d99d5c1e8b8208f.poster.avif?t=1785716835\" width=1096 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/413982015ce6f77c7d99d5c1e8b8208f.webm?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/413982015ce6f77c7d99d5c1e8b8208f.mp4?t=1785716835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt unique animals and forage the wilderness to survive. Create shelters and outposts to craft better tools and equip yourself to conquer the world's resources. As you play the animals around you will interact with each other and the plants that surround them. You can tame, breed, and ride them as you explore this unforgiving place. Lay low in the jungle and use precision strikes to keep yourself fed, or build a large base in the high plains and assert your territorial control with high caliber artillery and perimeter defenses. As you are not the only one in this universe to know about this planet, you may run into an intelligent species eager to claim its resources for their own. It's up to you to determine the outcome of your interactions. But rest assured, they want your resources. Pay attention to your sun as it ages. Once it's gone, all life is on borrowed time...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/78a101c0df6fed62ab7f880bfa67fd61.avif?t=1785716835\" width=354 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/extras/2680acd7f0de2164d58c84a599eb2900.webp?t=1785716835\" width=833 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PVP/Multiplayer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a dedicated server, or host a session on your machine with your friends, and if you wish, open up either to the public. Conquer your surroundings, drill for the most prized resources, and adapt to this world. Aim to plunder the loot of other players and build impregnable strongholds. Survival will not be easy with more enemies around. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Kit:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the game comes another application, the Evolution Survival Development Kit. This provides a means to make mods and maps for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Evolution Survival is a survival game where the universe evolves around you. The plants and animals you saw at the beginning will be different at the end, They may not even be there, the star may have gone supernova or shrunk into a white dwarf. Use the time you have to ensure your survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/397a2bd40ea5149fdf51050feeeda5d9ba3d7345/header.jpg?t=1785716835", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/3ca247e76d70f26d3676d0820169b9be1c4dba39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785716835", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640300/3ca247e76d70f26d3676d0820169b9be1c4dba39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785716835", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 2.5 GHz or faster.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A GTX 1050 will allow you to run the game on the lowest settings between 30-40fps</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-8700K @3.7GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2080TI 8GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This graphics card targets 60+fps at maximum settings. Lower end cards can still run the game.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["DrierWhisper729"], "publishers": ["DrierWhisper Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 47, "description": "LAN PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 48, "description": "LAN Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 30, "description": "Steam Workshop